-- 1118 (2026-11-06) — Every asymmetric 3-5-2: the inside winger drops
-- into the hole.
--
-- Owner: "on the 352(3L2) the 11 just like on the R one should be in
-- traditional 10 position above and between ... and others like it!"
-- 3-R2 got it in mig 1117.  Now 3-L2 and the 1-2 / 2-1 R and L shapes:
-- R = 7 in the hole ahead of the midfield, right of center, 11 alone up
-- top as the striker; L = 11 in the hole left of center, 7 the striker.
-- Numbers unchanged, so lineups saved on these shapes keep everyone in
-- his slot.  Drawn in FIELD_SIZES (game-center.js); wing backs ON the
-- halfway line as in every back-three shape.

